          "snippet": {
            "line": 285,
            "text": "theorem illustrative_feedthrough_scenario :\n    ∃ v : ℝ → ℝ, v 0 = 1 ∧\n      (∀ t ∈ Ico (0 : ℝ) 10, HasDerivWithinAt\n        (fun s => 9.4 * v s + 0.5 * (v s - uFeed s) + 0.1 * (v s - gFeed s))\n        (Inet nominal (uFeed t) (v t) + 0.5 * Real.sin t) (Ici t) t) ∧\n      IsTrajectory illustrative uFeed v 0 10 ∧\n      (∀ t ∈ Icc (3.43 : ℝ) 10, illustrative.decodeOut (v t) = some true) := by"
          },
          "declaration": {
            "id": "VoltageToBit.Examples.illustrative_feedthrough_scenario",
